<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/venezuela"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Venezuela.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Venezuela</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Dictator Marcos Pérez Jiménez is overthrown; the Punto Fijo pact follows</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/peoples-republic-of-china"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/People's%20Republic%20of%20China.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>People's Republic of China</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Great Leap Forward begins, leading to the famine of 1959–61</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/french-west-africa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/French%20West%20Africa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>French West Africa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Guinea votes for independence; the federation is wound up</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-colombia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Colombia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Colombia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The National Front begins sixteen years of shared Liberal–Conservative rule</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/islamic-republic-of-pakistan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Islamic%20Republic%20of%20Pakistan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Islamic Republic of Pakistan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">President Iskander Mirza imposes martial law and is succeeded by General Ayub Khan, who suspends the constitution; a presidential constitution follows in 1962.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/maoism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Maoism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Maoism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The famines that follow the Great Leap Forward begin; by some historians’ count thirty million die by 1961</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/pan-arabism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Pan-Arabism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Pan-Arabism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Egypt and Syria merge as the United Arab Republic under Nasser</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/northern-rhodesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Northern%20Rhodesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Northern Rhodesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Kenneth Kaunda and the younger radicals leave the Congress of Harry Nkumbula and form the Zambia African National Congress</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mao-zedong"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mao%20Zedong.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mao Zedong</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He launches the Great Leap Forward, followed by the Great Chinese Famine</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/declaration-of-the-rights-of-man-and-of-the-citizen"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Declaration%20of%20the%20Rights%20of%20Man%20and%20of%20the%20Citizen.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Declaration of the Rights of Man and of the Citizen</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The declaration is incorporated into the constitution of the Fifth Republic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/muqaddimah"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Muqaddimah.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Muqaddimah</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Franz Rosenthal publishes an English translation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/patrice-lumumba"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Patrice%20Lumumba.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Patrice Lumumba</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Helps found the Mouvement National Congolais and becomes its leader; attends the All-African Peoples' Conference in Accra in December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/pacifism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Pacifism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Pacifism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">British activists form the Campaign for Nuclear Disarmament with Bertrand Russell as its president</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/african-socialism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/African%20socialism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>African socialism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Nkrumah helps found the Union of Independent African States of Ghana, Mali and Guinea; Senegal votes 97% for association with France in the referendum</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/rastafari"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rastafari.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rastafari</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After the first Rastafarian Universal Convention in Back-o-Wall, Kingston, Rasta militants unsuccessfully try to capture the city in Haile Selassie's name</span></li></ul></section>
